          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पछाड़ना — pachāṛnā — \"to throw down; to overpower\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "एक सिपाही ने दो दुश्मनों को पछाड़ा। ek sipāhī ne do duśmanoṁ ko pachāṛā. One soldier overpowered two enemies."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with ने (he or she …): उसने दुश्मन को पछाड़ा, usne duśman ko pachāṛā."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पछाड़ना (pachāṛnā) is inherited from pracchaṭ, a form CDIAL reconstructs (CDIAL 8493), with the sense of knocking down. It is the wrestler's word: to throw the other to the ground, and so to beat them."
            }
          ]
        },
